  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: <br>&bull; Product description: <br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): <br>&bull; Payment terms: <br>&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n<section id=\"shopify-section-template--15387170537545__rich_text_AqLXmq\" class=\"shopify-section section\">\r\n<div class=\"isolate\">\r\n<div class=\"rich-text content-container color-background-1 gradient rich-text--full-width content-container--full-width section-template--15387170537545__rich_text_AqLXmq-padding\">\r\n<div class=\"rich-text__wrapper rich-text__wrapper--center page-width\">\r\n<div class=\"rich-text__blocks center\">\r\n<h2 class=\"rich-text__heading rte inline-richtext h2 scroll-trigger animate--slide-in\" data-cascade=\"\"><strong>Welcome to AT HOME ESCAPES</strong></h2>\r\n<h2 class=\"rich-text__heading rte inline-richtext h2 scroll-trigger animate--slide-in\" data-cascade=\"\"><strong>Unlock the thrill of Escape Rooms at home or ANYWHERE</strong></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<section id=\"shopify-section-template--15387170537545__rich_text_DMeCDq\" class=\"shopify-section section\">\r\n<div class=\"isolate page-width\">\r\n<div class=\"rich-text content-container color-background-1 gradient section-template--15387170537545__rich_text_DMeCDq-padding\">\r\n<div class=\"rich-text__wrapper rich-text__wrapper--center\">\r\n<div class=\"rich-text__blocks center\">\r\n<div class=\"rich-text__text rte scroll-trigger animate--slide-in\" data-cascade=\"\">\r\n<p>Dive into a world of mystery and excitement with our<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>Printable Escape Rooms</strong>. Perfect for solo adventurers, families, and parties, our escape rooms offer:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Instant Download</strong>: Jump straight into action.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Diverse Themes</strong>: From historical to futuristic, find a theme for every taste.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Educational &amp; Fun</strong>: Boost problem-solving skills in a thrilling way.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Escape Rooms for Everyone:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Kids</strong>: Explore imaginative adventures with safe, fun puzzles.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Adults</strong>: Challenge yourself with complex puzzles and storylines.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Families</strong>: Bond over escape rooms designed for all ages.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Why Choose Us?</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>'No Cutting Required'</strong>: Easy setup for a seamless start.</li>\r\n<li><strong>'Cutting Required'</strong>: Engage fully with hands-on setup options.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Learn &amp; Play</strong>: Turn game time into a learning experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Start Your Adventure:</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Choose your escape room.</li>\r\n<li>Download, print, and play!</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Join Our Community:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Share stories, tips, and stay up-to-date with new releases and offers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Ready for Fun?</strong><br>Explore our collection at<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>AT HOME ESCAPES</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>and unlock your next thrilling adventure. Where every puzzle is a step towards unforgettable memories!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>",
